---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import FeatureCard from '../components/FeatureCard.astro';
import ProofBand from '../components/ProofBand.astro';
import FadeUpOnScroll from '../components/FadeUpOnScroll.astro';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const features = (await getCollection('features')).sort(
  (a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order,
);
---

<Layout>
  {/* Hero — dark, purple accent */}
  <section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-950 via-slate-950 to-slate-900"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-32 -top-32 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-32 top-1/3 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-10 pb-6 sm:pt-14 sm:pb-8">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="text-center lg:text-left">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-purple-400">
            By SOS Services · 4 regulatory authorities
          </p>
          <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
            For the hangar floor, not the audit binder.
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-3 text-base text-slate-300 sm:text-lg">
            FAA, EASA, CAAC, SACAA workflows first-class — not bolted on. Built
            for carriers who can't afford a seven-figure SAP rollout, or a missed
            inspection.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row lg:justify-start">
            <a
              href="/contact"
              class="rounded-lg bg-purple-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 shadow-sm transition hover:bg-purple-400"
            >
              Join AMRO Pro pilot
            </a>
            <a
              href="#features"
              class="rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-100 transition hover:border-slate-500 hover:bg-slate-900"
            >
              See the platform →
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
            FAA · EASA · CAAC · SACAA · Multi-tenant · Audit-ready
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="relative aspect-[16/10] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-800/60 bg-slate-900/40 shadow-2xl shadow-purple-500/10 backdrop-blur">
          <img
            src="/app-preview.svg"
            alt="AMRO Pro — multi-regulator work order workspace"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover object-top"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Proof band — merged trust badges + outcome metrics + regulator-readable disclaimer */}
  <ProofBand />

  {/* Features grid */}
  <section id="features" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="mb-10 flex items-end justify-between">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">What's inside AMRO Pro</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600">
          Eight modules that connect a maintenance manual to a regulator-ready record.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {features.map((feature) => <FeatureCard feature={feature} />)}
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Why */}
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="motion-rise mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Why AMRO Pro instead of a 1990s MRO suite</h2>
      <dl class="mt-10 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">Built for four regulators from day one</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            FAA, EASA, CAAC, SACAA. Not "FAA with a translation layer." Authority-aware
            forms, deadlines, sign-off chains.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">Provenance, not paperwork</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Every task signed off has a digital chain — who, when, against which MPD
            revision, against which AD. Inspectors get evidence, not stapled binders.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">Multi-tenant, multi-MRO</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Independent MROs serving multiple operators share a platform without sharing
            data. Each operator's records are their own.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">Parts traceability that holds up</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Chain-of-custody from purchase order to installation, with airworthiness
            tags preserved. No more spreadsheets-of-truth that crumble during an audit.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">Modern engineering</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Express microservice, React frontend, Postgres with RLS. The same stack
            powering modern SaaS — applied to a field that's been stuck on Oracle Forms.
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="font-medium">No license-by-airframe pricing</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Per-tenant SaaS pricing. Add an aircraft, the math doesn't break. Add a
            regulator, the platform doesn't need a re-implementation.
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Pricing — pilot tiers */}
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="motion-rise mb-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-purple-700">Pricing</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Per-aircraft, transparent.</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-xl text-slate-600">
        Indicative pilot pricing. Final tiers publish at GA — design-partner operators
        lock in this rate for 24 months.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="motion-rise grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Operator</p>
        <p class="mt-3 flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">₹29,000</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">/ month / aircraft</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">For regional carriers running their own maintenance.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Work orders + MPD + parts traceability</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Single regulator (FAA / EASA / CAAC / SACAA)</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Audit-trail bundles per work order</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Up to 50 mechanic seats / aircraft</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact?tier=operator" class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 hover:border-slate-300">
          Start pilot
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="relative flex flex-col rounded-2xl border-2 border-purple-500 bg-white p-8 shadow-lg">
        <span class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-purple-500 px-3 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-white">
          Most popular
        </span>
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700">MRO Shop</p>
        <p class="mt-3 flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">₹2,99,000</span>
          <span class="text-sm text-slate-500">/ month / shop</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">For independent MROs serving multiple operators.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Unlimited aircraft booking work into the shop</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Everything in Operator</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Multi-regulator workflows in one shop</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Per-operator data isolation (multi-tenant RLS)</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Unlimited mechanic seats</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact?tier=mro-shop" class="mt-6 rounded-lg bg-purple-600 px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-purple-700">
          Start MRO Shop pilot
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Enterprise</p>
        <p class="mt-3 flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Custom</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">For multi-shop MRO groups or carriers with mixed fleets.</p>
        <ul class="mt-6 flex-1 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Cross-shop visibility + global MPD library</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Dedicated CSM + 99.9% uptime SLA</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Custom regulator workflows on request</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>Direct regulator co-audit support</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-purple-500">✓</span><span>On-prem deployment option</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/contact?tier=enterprise" class="mt-6 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-4 py-2 text-center text-sm font-medium text-slate-900 hover:border-slate-300">
          Talk to sales
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* From the studio rail */}
  <section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="motion-rise mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16">
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-end justify-between">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700">From the studio</p>
          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">How we build AMRO Pro</h2>
        </div>
        <a
          href="https://sosservices.online/engineering/"
          class="hidden text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 sm:block"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          All engineering posts ↗
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        <a
          href="https://sosservices.online/engineering/when-an-mro-outgrows-spreadsheets/"
          class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-md"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700">MRO</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
            When an MRO outgrows spreadsheets
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            The specific failure modes that arrive when work orders, parts, and
            airworthiness records all live in Excel. Why the next step usually isn't SAP.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">Read on sosservices.online →</p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://sosservices.online/engineering/multi-tenant-rls-at-studio-scale/"
          class="block rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:border-slate-300 hover:shadow-md"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Engineering</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
            Multi-tenant RLS at studio scale
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            How AMRO Pro isolates MRO operators sharing a platform. The 905-migration
            drift incident. The zombie connections that blocked an ALTER TABLE.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">Read on sosservices.online →</p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://aviation.sosservices.online"
          class="block rounded-2xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50/40 p-6 transition hover:border-red-300 hover:shadow-md"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-red-700">Sibling product</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
            Aviation AI Pro — flight data analytics
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            ARINC 717 parsing, multi-vendor DLU decoding, approach scoring, DGCA-ready
            exports. AMRO's safety-data cousin in the studio.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">Visit aviation.sosservices.online →</p>
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://sthira.sosservices.online"
          class="block rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50/40 p-6 transition hover:border-emerald-300 hover:shadow-md"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-700">Sibling product</p>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900">
            Sthira — retail investing, built calm
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">
            Goal-based SIPs and pre-authorized rebalancing for layman investors. The LLM
            explains. It never trades.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-900">Visit sthira.sosservices.online →</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <FadeUpOnScroll />
</Layout>
